  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A clinical collaborator asked me to look at gene interactions in her 15 sepsis samples. All she gave me is the gene-by-sample expression table; there are no motif or PPI files."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"A clinical collaborator asked me to look at gene interactions in her 15 sepsis samples.\" -- available from LIONESS-COEXPRESSION or COBRA. Not stated in your request: COBRA needs more genes than samples -- checked against your files before any run.\n2. \"All she gave me is the gene-by-sample expression table; there are no motif or PPI files.\" -- available from LIONESS-COEXPRESSION, COBRA or BONOBO. Not stated in your request: COBRA needs more genes than samples -- checked against your files before any run.\n\nSeveral registered methods fit this result; they differ in their modeling assumptions:\n\n- **LIONESS-COEXPRESSION** — LIONESS represents the cohort network through sample contributions: W_q = N*W_all - (N-1)*W_without_q, where N is the cohort size and the same base estimator is fitted with and without sample q. Needs expression matrix.\n- **COBRA** — COBRA models co-expression as a function of sample covariates through conditional covariance estimation. Needs expression matrix and sample covariate design matrix.\n- **BONOBO** — BONOBO applies Bayesian estimation and shrinkage to sample-specific gene-gene co-expression. Needs expression matrix.\n\nShould the result be aggregate or sample-specific?\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
